ir</a></li></ol></li><li><a href="#Estimating_the_relative_importance_of_the_resonance_contributors" rel="internal">Estimating the relative importance of the resonance contributors</a><ol><li><a href="#Rules_for_estimating_the_relative_importance_of_resonance_contributors" rel="internal">Rules for estimating the relative importance of resonance contributors</a></li><li><a href="#Comparing_resonance_stabilization_of_similar_compounds" rel="internal">Comparing resonance stabilization of similar compounds</a></li></ol></li><li><a href="#A_controversy_over_hypervalent_or_octet-valent_states_of_.5C(.5Cce.7BP.7D.5C)_and_.5C(.5Cce.7BS.7D.5C)_compounds" rel="internal">A controversy over hypervalent or octet-valent states of \(\ce{P}\) and \(\ce{S}\) compounds </a></li></ol>
